# Root-level environment variables for the monorepo.
#
# Each workspace manages its own environment file:
#   backend/.env.example   - server-side (private) variables
#   frontend/.env.example  - browser-exposed (NEXT_PUBLIC_*) variables
#
# To set up locally:
#   1. cp backend/.env.example backend/.env
#   2. cp frontend/.env.example frontend/.env.local
#   3. Fill in real values. Never commit .env files.